[h1]Languages[/h1][url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/data/assets/fly-speed-modifier/README/README.html]EN/English[/url] | [url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/data/assets/fly-speed-modifier/README/README_ZH-CN.html]ZH-CN/简体中文[/url]
[h1]Fly Speed Modifier[/h1]A client-side Fabric mod that temporarily multiplies Freecam and direct flight speed while you hold a key and scroll the mouse wheel.
[h2]Features[/h2][list]
[*]Supports Freecam speed multiplier adjustment[/*]
[*]Supports normal / direct player flight speed multiplier adjustment[/*]
[*]Resets the multiplier to [b]1x[/b] when the adjust key is pressed[/*]
[*]Supports a Mod Menu configuration screen when Cloth Config is installed[/*]
[*]Supports configurable minimum multiplier, maximum multiplier, and scroll adjustment speed[/*]
[*]Hold Alt key to adjust flight speed multiplier[/*]
[*]Uses a non-linear max-multiplier slider for finer low-range control[/*]
[*]Uses non-linear mouse-wheel multiplier adjustment[/*]
[*]Supports Vanilla Creative Flight, and [url=https://modrinth.com/mod/freecam]Freecam[/url][/*]
[/list][h2]Supported Versions[/h2][list]
[*]Minecraft 26.1.2[/*]
[*]Fabric Loader 0.19.2+[/*]
[*]Fabric API 0.150.0+[/*]
[*]Java 25[/*]
[*]Freecam (Optional)[/*]
[*]Cloth Config 26.1.154+fabric (Optional)[/*]
[*]Mod Menu 18.0.0-beta.1 (Optional)[/*]
[/list][h2]License[/h2]MIT
